#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "156_Nervous Man"
msgid "I'm not gonna make it! Man, this day is the worst! I\\r\nshould've just stayed home..."
msgstr "¡No puedo más! ¡Mis edad ya me está pasando factura!\\r\nDebí haberme quedado en casa..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "168_Akiyama"
msgid "Excuse me, is something wrong?"
msgstr "Oye, ¿todo bien?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "180_Nervous Man"
msgid "Oh, uh, actually, talking just makes it worse, and I'm not\\r\ngetting my hopes up, but do you by any chance have any\\r\nstomach medicine...?"
msgstr "¡Ay! Hablar de ello solo lo empeora. No quiero\\r\nhacerme muchas ilusiones pero, ¿tendrías por\\r\ncasualidad algo para el estómago...?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "204_Nervous Man"
msgid "Sorry, I don't."
msgstr "Lo siento, no tengo nada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "216_Nervous Man"
msgid "Well, I figured as much. That's life..."
msgstr "Bueno, ya me lo esperaba. Así es la vida..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "228_Nervous Man"
msgid "As a matter of fact, I do!"
msgstr "¡Da la casualidad de que sí tengo algo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "240_Nervous Man"
msgid "You do? It's a miracle! Please, let me－"
msgstr "¡M-milagro! ¡P-por favor, dámelo...!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "252_Akiyama"
msgid "Er, I don't mean to be a jerk here, but I really can't give\\r\nit to you for free. Sorry about that."
msgstr "Mire, no quiero ser un cretino, pero no puedo dárselo\\r\ngratis. Lo siento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "264_Nervous Man"
msgid "I'll pay! Oh, I'll pay! Before it's too late... No! Ugh...\\r\nUh-oh..."
msgstr "¡Pagaré! ¡Pagaré lo que sea! Démelo antes de que\\r\nsea muy tarde... ¡Nooo...! Ugh... Ay, no..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "276_Akiyama"
msgid "I really am sorry."
msgstr "De verdad que lo siento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "288_Nervous Man"
msgid "Ack! Have a heart, will ya...!?"
msgstr "¡No seas cruel, vamos...!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "300_Nervous Man"
msgid "Yikes! Here, try this."
msgstr "¡Va, va! Toma, bebe esto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "372_Relieved Man"
msgid "Ah, it's good to be alive! ♥"
msgstr "¡Ah, que bueno es estar vivo! ♥"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "384_Relieved Man"
msgid "Sorry, I was a little distracted there. You have my thanks."
msgstr "Lo siento, me distraje un momento. Le agradezco mucho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "396_Akiyama"
msgid "Don't mention it..."
msgstr "Ni lo menciones..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "408_Relieved Man"
msgid "Whoops! I nearly neglected to give you a token of my\\r\ngratitude. That won't do, now, will it? Heheh."
msgstr "¡Uy! Casi me olvido de darle algo en agradecimiento.\\r\nEso no estaría bien, ¿verdad? Je, je."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "420_Relieved Man"
msgid "It's not much, but I hope you'll accept it."
msgstr "No es mucho, pero espero que le sirva."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "432_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, um, while I appreciate the sentiment, could you maybe\\r\ngive me something other than money?"
msgstr "Oh, aprecio mucho la intención, pero ¿sería posible que me\\r\ndieras otra cosa que no sea dinero?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "444_Relieved Man"
msgid "Hmm? Something other than money? You're a rarity, my friend!"
msgstr "¿Mmm? ¿Algo que no sea dinero? ¡Así que no eres alguien codicioso!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "456_Relieved Man"
msgid "Let's see. Something that's not money..."
msgstr "Veamos. Algo diferente al dinero..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "468_Relieved Man"
msgid "I'm sorry to say, these are about the extent of what I can\\r\ngive you..."
msgstr "Lamento decir que esto es todo lo que puedo ofrecerle\\r\nahora mismo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "480_Akiyama"
msgid "What are they?"
msgstr "¿Qué son?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "492_Relieved Man"
msgid "Tickets to a concert my company put together. This orchestra\\r\nputs on an excellent performance, let me tell you."
msgstr "Son entradas para un concierto que organizó nuestra empresa.\\r\nEsta orquesta es de primer nivel, se lo garantizo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "504_Relieved Man"
msgid "Of course, I don't know if you can make it. The concert's\\r\ntoday. What do you think?"
msgstr "Aunque, no sé si podrá asistir. El concierto es hoy.\\r\n¿Qué le parece? ¿Las acepta?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "516_Akiyama"
msgid "Yes, absolutely! That's perfect. I'll gladly take those off\\r\nyour hands."
msgstr "¡Sí, por supuesto! Muchas gracias. Me vienen\\r\nde maravilla."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "528_Relieved Man"
msgid "Ah, a classical buff, are you!? Will wonders never cease?"
msgstr "¡Vaya, un amante de la música clásica! ¡Qué genial!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "540_Akiyama"
msgid "Indeed. Now, if you'll excuse me."
msgstr "Así es. Ahora, si me disculpa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "552_Relieved Man"
msgid "Of course. Enjoy the concert!"
msgstr "Por supuesto. ¡Disfrute del concierto!"

